               \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m \u001b[2m› \u001b[0mThat is the sharp edge: a lost response looks identical \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n                                                          \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   to theft. Added a 10 second grace window where          \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n                                                          \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m   replaying the immediately-previous j…                   \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n                                                          \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m                                                           \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n                                                          \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m                                                           \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m\u001b[K\r\n                                                          \u001b[2m│\u001b[0m                                                    "]
